<mxfile host="CrabShare-generator" modified="2026-10-22T14:53:34.031Z" agent="crabshare-drawio-gen" version="24.7.17" type="device"><diagram name="Index" id="Index"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.8–4.28 – State Machine Diagrams – index of main entities with a status column&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Version 2.0 · 22/10/2026 · UML 2.5 · states = CHECK constraint values · label = trigger [guard] / effect&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="900" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;table style=&quot;font-size:10px;border-collapse:collapse&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Figure&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Entity.column&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;States (CHECK constraint)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Module&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.8&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;batch.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Draft, PendingApproval, Funding, Stocked, InProduction, Harvesting, Rejected, Cancelled, Settlement, Closed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Batches (Viên) · Funding, Settlement (Thiện) · Production, Harvest (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.9&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;contribution.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Reserved, Confirmed, Expired, Refunded&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Funding (Thiện)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;investment_contract.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Draft, OperatorSigned, FullySigned, Void&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Contracts (Thiện)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;payment_request.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Pending, Paid, Expired, Cancelled&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Payments (Thiện)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.12&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;payment_instruction.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Created, Sent, Succeeded, Failed, Disputed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Payments (Thiện)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.13&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;disbursement_tranche.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Planned, Requested, Released, NeedsExplanation, Blocked&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Payments (Thiện) · created by Batches (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.14&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;settlement.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Draft, Proposed, Disputed, Approved, PaidOut, Closed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Settlement (Thiện)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.15&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;settlement_feedback.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Open, Answered, Unresolved, Withdrawn&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Settlement (Thiện)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.16&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;batch_account.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Requested, Open, Frozen, Closed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Funding / Payments (Thiện)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.17&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;product_listing.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Draft, Published, SoldOut, Closed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Catalog (Nhân)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.18&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;sales_order.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;PendingPayment, Paid, Packed, Shipping, Delivered, Completed, DepositPaid, Cancelled, Returned&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Orders (Nhân)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.19&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;stock_reservation.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Active, Committed, Released&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Orders (Nhân)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.20&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;complaint.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Open, OperatorResponded, Escalated, Resolved, Rejected&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Orders (Nhân)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.21&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;offtake_commitment.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;PendingHarvest, WindowOpen, Fulfilled, Cancelled, Expired&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Offtake (Nhân)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.22&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;offtake_commitment.deposit_status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Pending, Held, Applied, Refunded, Forfeited&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Offtake (Nhân)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.23&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;operator.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Draft, Submitted, Approved, Rejected, Suspended&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Operators (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.24&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;physical_slot.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Available, Occupied, Maintenance&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Boxes (Viên) · Production, Harvest (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.25&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;standard_cost_version.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Draft, Submitted, Locked, Superseded, Approved&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Batches (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.26&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;crab_item.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Growing, InStock, Packed, Sold, Dead, Lost, DeliveredInKind&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Production, Harvest (Viên) · Orders (Nhân)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.27&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;crab_tag.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Printed, Active, Void&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Harvest (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.28&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;harvest.lifecycle_status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Open, Completed, Legacy (NULL)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Harvest (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.29&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;app_user.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Active, Locked, PendingVerification&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Auth (Thiện) · Accounts (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.30&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;investor.verification_status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Unverified, Verified, Rejected&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Accounts (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.31&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;payout_account.status (+ name_match_status)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Active, Locked, Closed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Accounts (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.32&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;evidence.review_status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Accepted, Watch, Flagged, Rejected&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Evidence (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.33&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;capture_request.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Open, Fulfilled, Expired&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Evidence (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.34&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;alert.status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Open, Acknowledged, Escalated, Resolved&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Alerts (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="60" width="1300" height="634" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="&lt;b&gt;Status columns without a diagram (classifications, not lifecycles):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• provider_transaction.match_status: Matched | Unmatched | LatePayment — set once when the webhook is booked, never changes.&lt;br&gt;• contract_template.status, risk_disclosure.status: Draft → Active → Retired — document versioning handled by seed/admin data, no API transitions.&lt;br&gt;• payout_account.name_match_status: Pending | Matched | Mismatched — written together with payout_account.status (see that page).&lt;br&gt;• harvest_record.tag_status: immutable snapshot, always &quot;Printed&quot; at recording time (trigger tr_harvest_record_immutable); the live state is crab_tag.status.&lt;br&gt;• kyc_check.result: Passed | Failed | ExceptionApproved — one row per check; only Failed → ExceptionApproved changes (UC06)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="714" width="1300" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="batch.status" id="batch_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.8 – State Machine Diagram – batch.status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Version 2.0 · 22/10/2026 · UML 2.5 · states = CHECK constraint values · label = trigger [guard] / effect · module: Batches (Viên) · Funding, Settlement (Thiện) · Production, Harvest (Viên)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="900" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source:&lt;/b&gt; BatchesController/AdminBatchesController → BatchService · BatchReviewService · FundingCloseService · StockingService · HarvestService.StartAsync · SettlementService.CalculateAsync · SettlementClosing.CloseIfPaidAsync&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="48" width="1300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Draft" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" paren